NAME
       rm - remove files and directories

SYNOPSIS
       rm [-fiRrv] file ...

DESCRIPTION
       Unlinks each FILE. Directories are only removed with -R.

OPTIONS
       -f     ignore missing files and never prompt
       -i     prompt before every removal
       -R, -r remove directories and everything inside them
       -v     print each file as it is removed

EXIT STATUS
       Non-zero if any operand could not be removed.

SEE ALSO
       rmdir(1), unlink(2)
